 tour of the city back and forth. I highly recommend Let's Just Ride! Great experience."},{"business_id":"NlhEXGsDDpMdqZ6APCs8_w","review_id":"OyI9XQlndSaLtlNEKR_v7Q","date":"2019-06-08T03:10:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9333845376968384,"text_excerpt":"I have used 3 different services to get to and from the French Quarter over the past 4 years and this was the best service I have received. I would highly recommend you give them a try, I do not think you will be disappointed. Our driver was Joyce and she was very entertaining and informative. The round trip price from the airport to our hotel was very reasonable. Our first flight was canceled so the airline booked us on another flight which completely changed our schedule for arrival, then we ended up sitting waiting for a gate to open for another 45 minutes, it was stressing me out but Joyce was there with a smile on her face. If you need a ride to your hotel from the airport, I would d..."},{"business_id":"NlhEXGsDDpMdqZ6APCs8_w","review_id":"QLYEVPw0ypFkQKjl3rL1DQ","date":"2016-04-30T03:17:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9316792488098145,"text_excerpt":"Joyce is absolutely amazing! Having been to New Orleans at least 2x a year for the last 16, I can honestly say Let's Just Ride is the very best. Joyce was super-easy to communicate with both prior to our arrival in the city and during our stay. We went to the Whitney Plantation and Slavery Museum (which was phenomenal as well). The cost was beyond amazing considering the personalized treatment we received. Joyce is warm, interesting and super-knowledgable. By the end of our trip, she felt more like a friend. Honestly, these simple words don't do the experience justice! I plan on not only utilizing Let's Just Ride every time I'm in the city but recommending Joyce and her company to my frie..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
